# 按鈕與 LED 模組：插在 iCEBreaker 的 PMOD1A 上（Keys，src/keys.veryl）
# 4 個按鈕（上拉電阻，按下 = 0）和 4 顆 LED（限流電阻，1 = 亮）
board "PMOD keys"

part J1 pmod
part S1 btn
part S2 btn
part S3 btn
part S4 btn
part R1 res 10k               # S1 上拉：放開時讀到 1
part R2 res 10k
part R3 res 10k
part R4 res 10k
part D1 led
part D2 led
part D3 led
part D4 led
part R5 res 330               # D1 限流
part R6 res 330
part R7 res 330
part R8 res 330

net KEY1 J1.7  S1.1 R1.1
net KEY2 J1.8  S2.1 R2.1
net KEY3 J1.9  S3.1 R3.1
net KEY4 J1.10 S4.1 R4.1
net LED1 J1.1 D1.A
net LED2 J1.2 D2.A
net LED3 J1.3 D3.A
net LED4 J1.4 D4.A
net K1 D1.K R5.1
net K2 D2.K R6.1
net K3 D3.K R7.1
net K4 D4.K R8.1
net 3V3 J1.6 J1.12 R1.2 R2.2 R3.2 R4.2
net GND J1.5 J1.11 S1.2 S2.2 S3.2 S4.2 R5.2 R6.2 R7.2 R8.2

plug J1 icebreaker.PMOD1A
